		(property "Description" "High-speed USB 2.0 to UART/SPI/I2C/JTAG/SWD bridge, QFN-28 4x4mm, separate VIO (1.1-3.6V) for target-level I/O. EP is datasheet pin 0 (GND, optional but recommended), numbered 29 to match KiCad footprint - verify EP size vs datasheet 7.1. Pins 17/18 (CTS0/RTS0) are VCC domain, all other I/O in VIO domain. RTS0 pull-down at power-on disables EEPROM config; DTR0 pull-down switches DTR to TNOW."
